Output docs/demos/out/completion-terminal.webm
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type~ "nvim -n -i NONE docs/demos/isle/tour/tour.isle"
Enter
Hide
Sleep 2500ms
Type "G"
Type "o"
Show
Sleep 1000ms
Type~ "(rule (lower (Op.Neg y)) (em"
Sleep 3000ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type~ "y"
Sleep 2500ms
